              "reason": "The before context had no handler fields, its error dispatcher passed null callback arguments, and the verified preimage had no setter definition.",
              "source_evidence": [
                {
                  "evidence_id": "loc-4553a512d64d47e7aa28d553",
                  "quote": "    int              nbErrors; /* the number of errors detected */\n    int              fatalErr; /* abort processing */\n    int                 errNo; /* error code */\n    int                legacy; /* using XINCLUDE_OLD_NS */\n    int            parseFlags; /* the flags used for parsing XML documents */\n    xmlChar *\t\t base; /* the current xml:base */\n\n    void            *_private; /* application data */\n\n#ifdef FUZZING_BUILD_MODE_UNSAFE_FOR_PRODUCTION\n    unsigned long    incTotal; /* total number of processed inclusions */\n#endif\n    int\t\t\tdepth; /* recursion depth */\n    int\t\t     isStream; /* streaming mode */\n\n    xmlXPathContextPtr xpctxt;\n};\n"
                },
                {
                  "evidence_id": "loc-68152a031f937106f1ce21cc",
                  "quote": "    if (ctxt->fatalErr != 0)\n        return;\n    ctxt->nbErrors++;\n    res = __xmlRaiseError(NULL, NULL, NULL, ctxt, node, XML_FROM_XINCLUDE,\n                          error, XML_ERR_ERROR, NULL, 0,\n\t\t          (const char *) extra, NULL, NULL, 0, 0,\n\t\t          msg, (const char *) extra);\n"
                },
                {
                  "evidence_id": "loc-939a42fbe4a23ea4120d4129",
                  "quote": "Verified preimage file xinclude.c has no function definition named xmlXIncludeSetErrorHandler. The entire after definition consists of added lines. This establishes absence in this file only; other implementations or equivalent paths must still be considered."
                }
              ]
            },
            "after": {
              "requirement": "Reach XInclude processing with a configured context-specific structured handler and caller data, including forwarding to delegated parser and XPath contexts.",
              "applicability": "required",
              "harness_status": "unsat",
              "reason": "The new setter and dispatch paths support this state, while the fixed old target creates and processes its context without calling the setter.",
              "source_evidence": [
                {
                  "evidence_id": "loc-7a2591b456528e6cc5b35635",
                  "quote": "void\nxmlXIncludeSetErrorHandler(xmlXIncludeCtxtPtr ctxt,\n                           xmlStructuredErrorFunc handler, void *data) {\n    if (ctxt == NULL)\n        return;\n    ctxt->errorHandler = handler;\n    ctxt->errorCtxt = data;\n}\n"
                },
                {
                  "evidence_id": "loc-2c7cbaf895bc61b599113a1c",
                  "quote": "    if (ctxt->fatalErr != 0)\n        return;\n    ctxt->nbErrors++;\n    res = __xmlRaiseError(ctxt->errorHandler, NULL, ctxt->errorCtxt,\n                          ctxt, node, XML_FROM_XINCLUDE, error, XML_ERR_ERROR,\n                          NULL, 0, (const char *) extra, NULL, NULL, 0, 0,\n\t\t          msg, (const char *) extra);\n"
                },
                {
                  "evidence_id": "loc-a2c69ddac2c81f1d6f382748",
                  "quote": "    pctxt = xmlNewParserCtxt();\n    if (pctxt == NULL) {\n\txmlXIncludeErrMemory(ctxt);\n\treturn(NULL);\n    }\n    if (ctxt->errorHandler != NULL)\n        xmlCtxtSetErrorHandler(pctxt, ctxt->errorHandler, ctxt->errorCtxt);\n"
                },
                {
                  "evidence_id": "loc-cc3978cb9b6bbf200179a509",
                  "quote": "        if (ctxt->xpctxt == NULL) {\n            ctxt->xpctxt = xmlXPtrNewContext(doc, NULL, NULL);\n            if (ctxt->xpctxt == NULL) {\n                xmlXIncludeErrMemory(ctxt);\n                goto error;\n            }\n            if (ctxt->errorHandler != NULL)\n                xmlXPathSetErrorHandler(ctxt->xpctxt, ctxt->errorHandler,\n                                        ctxt->errorCtxt);\n"
                }
              ]
            },
